      <section id="how-it-works" class="how-section" data-home>
        <div class="wrap how-layout"><div class="how-copy"><p class="eyebrow">SMALL TOKEN. MAIN CHARACTER ENERGY.</p><h2>A receipt for<br /><span class="display-accent">being there.</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="little-star">✷</span></h2><p>POAP stands for Proof of Attendance Protocol.<br />We like to think of it as a bookmark for your life.</p><div class="steps"><div><span>01</span><p><b>Show up.</b> To a gig, a gathering, a very good Tuesday.</p></div><div><span>02</span><p><b>Pick up a POAP.</b> A digital keepsake from the people who made it happen.</p></div><div><span>03</span><p><b>Keep the feeling.</b> Your collection becomes a scrapbook that’s unmistakably you.</p></div></div></div><figure class="press-figure iso" data-theme="light"><div class="press-card"><div class="press-meta"><span>FIG. 01</span><span>THE MEMORY PRESS</span></div><div id="press-art"></div><div class="press-bottom"><button id="press-button">Press a little memory <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></button><span id="press-readout" data-readout>READY WHEN YOU ARE</span></div></div><figcaption>Good times go in. A little forever comes out.<br /><span>A playful illustration of collecting a POAP.</span></figcaption></figure></div>
      </section>
